# Release secrets and artifacts: never in git. All release secrets live in the
# repo's git-ignored secrets/ folder (see specs/04_release_machine_inventory.md);
# the patterns below are a safety net.
# Upload keystore (*.jks / *.keystore) and local.properties are ignored above.
/secrets/
*service-account*.json
*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json
supabase/.env*
supabase/.temp/
backend/.env*
*.aab
android/app/release/
*.sql.gz
supabase_dump*/
.env.*
!.env.example
cozy-secrets/
*.secrets.env
